 nov-2026-1\n\nTip Takes the Town is a meet and greet with WNBA champion T
 iffany Hayes of the Valkyries at Rush Bowls Oakland. The event features a
  photo op\, limited-edition merch\, autographs and Tip's signature bowl\,
  with sounds by DJ Heartbreak. It celebrates the Valkyries' championship 
 season and runs 3-5 PM. Tickets are sold out.
